{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99404","id":2185921130,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6CSoJq","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99404","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99404.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99404.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99404","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99404/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/99404/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99404/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/2de017fe681ec5576c7b281ec8b7ccab4081eb23","number":99404,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Implement VisualShader Node Groups/Subgraphs","user":{"login":"Geometror","id":50084500,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMDg0NTAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50084500?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror","html_url":"https://github.com/Geometror","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Geometror/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR introduces **VisualShader Node Groups/Subgraphs**, enabling the creation, editing, and reuse of grouped VisualShader nodes for enhanced modularity and efficiency in shader workflows.\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/7730\r\n\r\n### See https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99404#issuecomment-3967282729 for recent updates\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1387\" height=\"860\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3e44ac1-bdcc-42c2-b466-e759ef76b903\" />\r\n\r\n## **Detailed changes:**\r\n- Refactor the VisualShaderEditor editor for editing both VisualShader and VisualShaderGroup\r\n\t- ShaderGraph abstraction (via composition, because inheritance is not possible  since `VisualShader` already inherits from `Shader` and `VisualShaderGroup` shouldn't; + multiple inheritance/interfaces aren't allowed)\r\n- Add VisualShaderGroup resource\r\n\t- Has a very similar API to VisualShader (subject to change)\r\n- Add VisualShaderNodeGroup\r\n\r\n\t![Pasted image 20241118195906](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6ea7caf7-a5b4-4480-b5b3-617ae6cf888a)\r\n\t- Functions as an instance of a VisualShaderGroup\r\n\t- Displays the groups name in its titlebar\r\n\t- Edit button in titlebar\r\n\t\t- You can enter the group by pressing this button and return by pressing the arrow button in the menu bar.  Groups can be arbitrarily nested, so a breadcrumb navigation could make sense in this\r\n- Edit groups inside of the VisualShader editor\r\n\t- Each group has a input and output node\r\n\t- The input and output ports can be edited via the new group ports dialog:\r\n\t- Open it by pressing the respective button on the input/output node\r\n\r\n     ![Pasted image 20241118195800](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a0d55f6-7b19-4def-bbc3-ead4fb4b5430)\r\n\t ![Pasted image 20241118195724](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c45e179d-19f4-4a39-9cf6-3520089471c6)\r\n\r\n## **To-Do:**\r\n- [x] Fix/implement port previews inside groups\r\n- [x] Fix certain edge cases for shader generation\r\n~- [ ] Open VisualShaderGroup resources directly in the shader editor~\r\n- [x] Proper validation \r\n\t- Check for conflicts in shader generation\r\n\t- Disallow parameters and varyings \r\n\t- Disallow other unsupported stuff based on shader type\r\n\t- Disallow recursion\r\n- [x] Cleanup/self-review\r\n~- [ ] Implement quick group creation from selection  (maybe subsequent PR)~\r\n~- [ ] Implement \"empty\" port for group input/output nodes that creates a new port automatically if you connect something to it (maybe subsequent PR)~\r\n~- [ ] Implement breadcrumb navigation, similar to AnimationTree (subsequent PR)~","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_ur